        "description": "**im-gateway 生产代码从不发送本帧** —— 鉴权成功后发的是 `auth_ok`(见 `serverAuthOk`)。本变体只有 `im-testkit` 的 mock server 在用。aux-13 §1.2.1 规定的是本帧, 故这是「代码偏离规范」的已知点, 但**不**擅自改成 `connected`(那会变动客户端可见的 wire 形状)。见 `docs/gap-ledger.md` §1.8.2。",
        "payload": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ServerConnectedFrame" },
        "x-im-spec-status": "declared",
        "x-im-spec-ref": "aux-13 §1.2.1",
        "x-im-implementation-status": "reserved-not-emitted",
        "x-im-ledger-ref": "docs/gap-ledger.md §1.8.2"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Uuid": {
        "title": "UUID",
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uuid"
      },
      "UnixMillis": {
        "title": "Unix 毫秒时间戳",
        "type": "integer",
        "format": "int64",
        "description": "`ErrorBody.ts` 的单位是**毫秒**(非秒)。"
      },
      "DateTimeUtc": {
        "title": "RFC 3339 UTC 时间戳",
        "type": "string",
        "format": "date-time"
      },
      "FieldError": {
        "title": "FieldError",
        "type": "object",
        "description": "`ErrorBody.details` 的元素。仅 `VALIDATION_ERROR` 可能带。",
        "properties": {
          "field": { "type": "string" },
          "reason": { "type": "string" }
        },
        "required": ["field", "reason"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ErrorBody": {
        "title": "ErrorBody(WS 专用)",
        "type": "object",
        "description": "WS `ack.error` 的载荷。**与 REST 错误信封字段集不同**, 见 `info.description` 的对照表。\n\n`details` 带 `skip_serializing_if = \"Vec::is_empty\"`, 故为空时**整个 key 消失**(不是 `[]`)。im-gateway 当前**从不填充** `details`, 所以线上这个 key 基本不出现。\n\n`trace_id`: im-gateway 传空串(`handler.rs:148`), 故线上通常是 `\"\"`。aux-13 §1.2.4 的样例写的是 `tr_01HXY...` 形态, 与实现不一致。",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "错误码, 与 aux-03 §B 的 21 项取值域一致。"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "i18n key 或错误描述, **不是**面向最终用户的文案。"
          },
          "trace_id": { "type": "string" },
          "ts": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UnixMillis" },
          "details": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FieldError" }
          }
        },
        "required": ["code", "message", "trace_id", "ts"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "AckData": {
        "title": "AckData",
        "type": "object",
        "description": "`ack.ok=true` 时的 `data`。**三个字段全部带 `skip_serializing_if`**, 故都可能整个 key 消失 —— 一个非空的 `data` 对象也可能三个字段全无。",
        "properties": {
          "message_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "sequence": { "type": "integer", "format": "int64" },
          "idempotent_replay": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "`false` 时**整个 key 消失**(自定义谓词 `is_false`), 不是 `\"idempotent_replay\": false`。故判断重放要用「key 存在且为 true」, 不能用「值不等于 false」。"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "Reaction": {
        "title": "Reaction",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "emoji": { "type": "string" },
          "user_ids": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" }
          }
        },
        "required": ["emoji", "user_ids"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "MessageContent": {
        "title": "MessageContent",
        "description": "`Message.content` 的 6 种 kind, 由**内层 `kind`** 区分(aux-13 的样例只写了 `{\"text\":\"...\"}` 而漏掉内层 `kind`, 与实现不符; 本文件以代码为准)。\n\n带 `#[serde(default)]` 的可选字段在 wire 上**恒出现**, 为 `null` 当未提供 —— 它们被标为 `required` 且类型含 `\"null\"`。",
        "oneOf": [
          { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageContentText" },
          { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageContentImage" },
          { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageContentFile" },
          { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageContentSticker" },
          { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageContentSystem" },
          { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageContentCustom" }
        ]
      },
      "MessageContentText": {
        "title": "kind=text",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "kind": { "const": "text" },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 4000,
            "description": "服务端校验 1..=4000, 越界返 `VALIDATION_ERROR`。"
          }
        },
        "required": ["kind", "text"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "MessageContentImage": {
        "title": "kind=image",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "kind": { "const": "image" },
          "media_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "width": { "type": ["integer", "null"] },
          "height": { "type": ["integer", "null"] },
          "thumbnail_media_id": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "uuid" }
        },
        "required": ["kind", "media_id", "width", "height", "thumbnail_media_id"],
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "description": "`width` / `height` / `thumbnail_media_id` 恒出现在 wire 上(可为 null)。"
      },
      "MessageContentFile": {
        "title": "kind=file",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "kind": { "const": "file" },
          "media_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "file_name": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 255 },
          "size_bytes": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "Rust 是 `u64`; JSON 无无符号整型, 故按 int64 建模, 且必须 > 0。"
          },
          "mime_type": { "type": ["string", "null"] }
        },
        "required": ["kind", "media_id", "file_name", "size_bytes", "mime_type"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "MessageContentSticker": {
        "title": "kind=sticker",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "kind": { "const": "sticker" },
          "sticker_id": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64 }
        },
        "required": ["kind", "sticker_id"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "MessageContentSystem": {
        "title": "kind=system",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "kind": { "const": "system" },
          "event": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "已知取值 join / leave / kicked / renamed 等, 但服务端只校验非空, **不校验取值**。"
          },
          "actor_user_id": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "uuid" },
          "target_user_id": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "uuid" }
        },
        "required": ["kind", "event", "actor_user_id", "target_user_id"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "MessageContentCustom": {
        "title": "kind=custom",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "kind": { "const": "custom" },
          "schema": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 64,
            "description": "自定义载荷的 schema 名。"
          },
          "data": {
            "description": "任意 JSON(Rust 侧是 `serde_json::Value`)。**不强制是对象** —— 可以是数组、字符串、数字。"
          }
        },
        "required": ["kind", "schema", "data"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "WireMessage": {
        "title": "WireMessage",
        "type": "object",
        "description": "下行消息体。**10 个字段在 wire 上全部恒出现**(其中 `sender_id` / `reply_to` / `edited_at` 可为 `null`, `reactions` 恒为数组)。",
        "properties": {
          "id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "conversation_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "sequence": { "type": "integer", "format": "int64" },
          "sender_id": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "uuid" },
          "kind": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "由上行 `send_message.kind` 原样抄回, **不校验**它与 `content.kind` 一致。"
          },
          "content": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageContent" },
          "reply_to": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "uuid" },
          "state": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["sent", "delivered", "read", "recalled", "deleted"],
            "description": "字段本身是裸 `String`(serde 不校验), 但服务端只从 `MessageState::as_str()` 取值, 故取值域确定; 数据库 `messages.state` 有同样的 CHECK 约束。"
          },
          "created_at": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DateTimeUtc" },
          "edited_at": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" },
          "reactions": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Reaction" },
            "description": "**当前恒为 `[]`**(`hub.rs:423` 硬编码)。"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "conversation_id",
          "sequence",
          "sender_id",
          "kind",
          "content",
          "reply_to",
          "state",
          "created_at",
          "edited_at",
          "reactions"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ClientAuthFrame": {
        "title": "ClientFrame::Auth",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "auth" },
          "req_id": {
            "type": ["string", "null"],
            "format": "uuid",
            "description": "**可省略**。解析走 `handler.rs` 的私有 `AuthFrame`, 其 `req_id` 是 `#[serde(default)] Option<Uuid>`。省略或显式 null 时, 回程 `auth_ok.req_id` 也是 null。"
          },
          "access_token": { "type": "string" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "access_token"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ClientSendMessageFrame": {
        "title": "ClientFrame::SendMessage",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "send_message" },
          "req_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "conversation_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "idempotency_key": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid",
            "description": "重发保护键。相同 key 重发返 `ack.ok=true` + `data.idempotent_replay=true`。"
          },
          "kind": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "自由字符串, **与 `content.kind` 不互相校验**。已知取值 text / image / file / sticker / system / custom。"
          },
          "content": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageContent" },
          "reply_to": {
            "type": ["string", "null"],
            "format": "uuid",
            "description": "仅 `#[serde(default)]` 无 skip, 故 wire 上**恒出现**, 未引用消息时为 `null`。"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "type",
          "req_id",
          "conversation_id",
          "idempotency_key",
          "kind",
          "content",
          "reply_to"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ClientEditMessageFrame": {
        "title": "ClientFrame::EditMessage",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "edit_message" },
          "req_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "message_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "content": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageContent" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "req_id", "message_id", "content"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ClientRecallMessageFrame": {
        "title": "ClientFrame::RecallMessage",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "recall_message" },
          "req_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "message_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "req_id", "message_id"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ClientReactFrame": {
        "title": "ClientFrame::React",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "react" },
          "req_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "message_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "emoji": { "type": "string" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "req_id", "message_id", "emoji"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ClientMarkReadFrame": {
        "title": "ClientFrame::MarkRead",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "mark_read" },
          "req_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "conversation_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "sequence": { "type": "integer", "format": "int64" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "req_id", "conversation_id", "sequence"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ClientTypingFrame": {
        "title": "ClientFrame::Typing",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "typing" },
          "req_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "conversation_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "req_id", "conversation_id"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ClientPingFrame": {
        "title": "ClientFrame::Ping",
        "type": "object",
        "description": "唯一不带 `req_id` 的客户端帧, 因此服务端不回 `ack`。",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "ping" },
          "ts": {
            "type": ["integer", "null"],
            "format": "int64",
            "description": "仅 `#[serde(default)]` 无 skip, 故 wire 上**恒出现**, 未提供时为 `null`。"
          }
        },
        "required": ["type", "ts"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ServerAuthOkFrame": {
        "title": "auth_ok(非 ServerFrame 变体)",
        "type": "object",
        "description": "由 `handler.rs:381` 的裸 `serde_json::json!` 构造, **不在 `ServerFrame` 枚举里**。它**不是** aux-13 §1.2.1 的 `connected`, 也不带 `ok` / `data` 字段。",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "auth_ok" },
          "req_id": {
            "type": ["string", "null"],
            "format": "uuid",
            "description": "回显上行 `auth.req_id`; 上行省略时为 `null`。"
          }
        },
        "required": ["type", "req_id"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ServerAckFrame": {
        "title": "ServerFrame::Ack",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "ack" },
          "req_id": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid",
            "description": "协议级错误(解析不出请求)时为 `00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000` 哨兵, 而非省略。"
          },
          "ok": { "type": "boolean" },
          "data": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AckData" },
          "error": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorBody" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "req_id", "ok"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ServerMessageNewFrame": {
        "title": "ServerFrame::MessageNew",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "message_new" },
          "message": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WireMessage" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "message"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ServerMessageEditedFrame": {
        "title": "ServerFrame::MessageEdited",
        "type": "object",
        "description": "**缺 `conversation_id`**(aux-13 §1.2.6 未定义), 因此无法定向投递, 生产代码从不发送。",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "message_edited" },
          "message_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "content": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageContent" },
          "edited_at": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DateTimeUtc" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "message_id", "content", "edited_at"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ServerMessageRecalledFrame": {
        "title": "ServerFrame::MessageRecalled",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "message_recalled" },
          "message_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "conversation_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "message_id", "conversation_id"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ServerReactionAddedFrame": {
        "title": "ServerFrame::ReactionAdded",
        "type": "object",
        "description": "**缺 `conversation_id`**(aux-13 §1.2.8 未定义), 生产代码从不发送。",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "reaction_added" },
          "message_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "user_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "emoji": { "type": "string" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "message_id", "user_id", "emoji"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ServerPresenceUpdateFrame": {
        "title": "ServerFrame::PresenceUpdate",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "presence_update" },
          "user_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "裸 `String`, 服务端不校验。已知取值: online / offline / away / busy / invisible(来自源码行内注释, 非受约束枚举)。"
          }
        },
        "required": ["type", "user_id", "status"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ServerTypingFrame": {
        "title": "ServerFrame::Typing",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "typing" },
          "conversation_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" },
          "user_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "conversation_id", "user_id"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ServerPongFrame": {
        "title": "ServerFrame::Pong",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "pong" },
          "ts": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "description": "客户端省略 `ts` 时服务端回 `0`, 非原样回传。"
          }
        },
        "required": ["type", "ts"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ServerForceDisconnectFrame": {
        "title": "ServerFrame::ForceDisconnect",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "force_disconnect" },
          "reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "裸 `String`, 服务端不校验。已知取值: token_revoked / account_banned / account_deleted / admin_kick(来自源码行内注释)。"
          }
        },
        "required": ["type", "reason"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ServerConnectedFrame": {
        "title": "ServerFrame::Connected",
        "type": "object",
        "description": "枚举中存在, 但 im-gateway 生产代码**从不发送**(鉴权成功发的是 `auth_ok`)。",
        "properties": {
          "type": { "const": "connected" },
          "session_id": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid" }
        },
        "required": ["type", "session_id"],
        "additionalProperties": true
      }
    }
  }
}
